  "authSigningIn": "Signing in…",
  "aboutWhoWeAreTitle": "Who we are",
  "aboutWhoWeAreBody": "The Peace of the Lord Jesus. We are brothers and sisters from the Maranatha Christian Church in the Triângulo Mineiro region serving at the Maanaim of Uberlândia-MG. This application is not an official church application, but its purpose is to help all those in the praise ministry serving in the Work, following Church guidelines, 100% free of charge.",
  "aboutObjectiveTitle": "Objective",
  "aboutObjectiveParagraph1": "The goal of this application — called Praise Researcher in Sheet Music, Chords in General — is to assist worship team members with essential praise materials. To make it easy to search, access, and work offline, as many churches lack internet access.",
  "aboutObjectiveParagraph2": "Therefore, let us remain in prayer for all brethren involved in this project, whether in app development, content creation, app testing, or related efforts.",
  "tutorialAboutStep1Title": "About Us",
  "tutorialAboutStep1Message": "Learn about the history and the team behind the application. A **100% free** and collaborative initiative built to assist worship teams.",
  "tutorialAboutStep2Title": "Our Mission",
  "tutorialAboutStep2Message": "The main purpose is to facilitate access to **sheet music, chords, gestures, and audio**, with guaranteed **offline** operation even in places without internet.",
  "tutorialAboutStep3Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialAboutStep3Message": "Tap the **(i) icon** anytime you want to review this guide or check detailed instructions on any screen of the app!",
  "tutorialAppShortcutsStep1Title": "Shortcut Categories",
  "tutorialAppShortcutsStep1Message": "Navigate between tabs to explore commands grouped by context: **Navigation & Search**, **Setlist & Audio**, **Sheet Music**, and **Chords & Gestures**.",
  "tutorialAppShortcutsStep2Title": "High-Productivity Shortcuts",
  "tutorialAppShortcutsStep2Message": "Review shortcut keys and their actions. Side badges highlight the **contexts and viewers where each command operates**.",
  "tutorialAppShortcutsStep3Title": "Quick Access with the ? Key",
  "tutorialAppShortcutsStep3Message": "Press **?** (or **Shift + /**) on any app screen to open this **shortcuts center instantly** on Desktop and Web.",
  "tutorialAppShortcutsStep4Title": "Shortcuts Center Help",
  "tutorialAppShortcutsStep4Message": "Tap this icon to review instructions on PLPCG's **quick commands and shortcuts**.",
  "tutorialAudioStep1Title": "Track Information",
  "tutorialAudioStep1Message": "View the **title**, **number**, **author**, and **classification** of the praise or audio currently playing.",
  "tutorialAudioStep2Title": "Actions and Synchronization",
  "tutorialAudioStep2Message": "Access the **linked sheet music**, add **audio markers**, enable **follow audio** mode in the reader, and adjust **playback speed**.",
  "tutorialAudioStep3Title": "Progress Bar",
  "tutorialAudioStep3Message": "Track **current time**, **total duration**, and drag the slider to seek forward or backward. Registered **markers** are highlighted on the timeline.",
  "tutorialAudioStep4Title": "Playback Controls",
  "tutorialAudioStep4Message": "Control playback with **Play/Pause**, skip to the **previous or next track**, and quickly seek forward or backward by **10 seconds**.",
  "tutorialAudioStep5Title": "Practice Markers",
  "tutorialAudioStep5Message": "See all **timestamped markers** added to the track. Tap any marker to jump directly to that point in the rehearsal.",
  "tutorialAudioStep6Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialAudioStep6Message": "Whenever you have questions about the audio player, tap this **(i) icon** to review this step-by-step tutorial!",
  "tutorialCarouselSelectionStep1Title": "Reorder Setlist",
  "tutorialCarouselSelectionStep1Message": "Hold and drag the **drag handle** icon to change the order of praises in real time during the service or rehearsal.",
  "tutorialCarouselSelectionStep2Title": "Quick Navigation",
  "tutorialCarouselSelectionStep2Message": "Tap the **body of the praise** to jump immediately to it in the active sheet music or chord reader.",
  "tutorialCarouselSelectionStep3Title": "Remove from Selection",
  "tutorialCarouselSelectionStep3Message": "Tap the **×** button to remove the praise from the temporary service list without deleting your saved playlists.",
  "tutorialCarouselSelectionStep4Title": "Clear or Reset List",
  "tutorialCarouselSelectionStep4Message": "Use this action to **clear the active list** and start a new selection from scratch or discard the current draft.",
  "tutorialCarouselSelectionStep5Title": "Active Setlist Help",
  "tutorialCarouselSelectionStep5Message": "Check this **quick guide** whenever you have questions about organizing and operating your setlist.",
  "tutorialChordsStep1Title": "Key Transposition",
  "tutorialChordsStep1Message": "Raise or lower the song key in **semitones** using the **+** and **-** buttons (or keyboard). Tap the key number to **restore the original key**.",
  "tutorialChordsStep2Title": "Font Size",
  "tutorialChordsStep2Message": "Adjust the **text and chord size** for optimal reading on your screen using the **decrease** and **increase font** buttons.",
  "tutorialChordsStep3Title": "Auto-Scroll",
  "tutorialChordsStep3Message": "Start **auto-scroll** (**S** key) to play hands-free. Adjust **speed** with the speedometer icon or with the **[** and **]** keys.",
  "tutorialChordsStep4Title": "Theme and Fullscreen",
  "tutorialChordsStep4Message": "Switch between **light and dark mode** for better ambient visibility, and use **fullscreen** (**F** key) to focus exclusively on chords.",
  "tutorialChordsStep5Title": "Reading and Layout",
  "tutorialChordsStep5Message": "On wide screens, the **chords** are automatically arranged into **two columns**. Tapping or manually scrolling the screen **automatically pauses** auto-scroll.",
  "tutorialChordsStep6Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialChordsStep6Message": "Whenever you want to review this guide or clarify questions about using the Chord Reader, tap this **(i) icon**!",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep1Title": "Illustrated Bulletin",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep1Message": "Generates and shares an **image with the praise list** along with the direct link for viewing.",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep2Title": "Direct Link",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep2Message": "Copies or shares only the **shortened link**, ideal for quick messaging.",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep3Title": "Sharing Help",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep3Message": "Tap this icon to review **setlist sharing** options.",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep4Title": "Setlist Category",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep4Message": "Classify the setlist as **Evangelism**, **Learning**, **Medleys**, or **Special Service** to help others find it easily.",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep5Title": "Setlist Scope",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep5Message": "Check as **one-time** for sporadic events or leave unchecked if it is a **regular selection for regular services**.",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep6Title": "Community Publishing",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep6Message": "Tap **Publish** to make the list available on the public tab. The list can be accessed and imported by the entire church.",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep7Title": "Publishing Help",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep7Message": "Tap this icon to review instructions on **publishing setlists** in the community.",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep8Title": "Room Code or Link",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep8Message": "Type or paste the **7-character code** or **full URL** provided by the live room leader.",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep9Title": "Paste from Clipboard",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep9Message": "Tap **Paste** to instantly fill with the link you just copied from WhatsApp or messaging.",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep10Title": "Connect to Room",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep10Message": "Tap **Join** to enter the broadcast and follow **praise changes in real time**.",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep11Title": "Live Room Help",
  "tutorialCollaborationDialogsStep11Message": "Tap this icon to review instructions for **syncing as a follower** in a live room.",
  "tutorialContributeStep1Title": "Submission Context",
  "tutorialContributeStep1Message": "Indicate whether your contribution is **linked to a specific praise** or is a **general suggestion** for the app.",
  "tutorialContributeStep2Title": "Suggestion Description",
  "tutorialContributeStep2Message": "Describe in detail the **problem encountered**, **lyric or key correction**, or the **improvement** you would like to propose.",
  "tutorialContributeStep3Title": "Device Diagnostics",
  "tutorialContributeStep3Message": "Keep enabled to send **anonymous technical data** (system, browser, resolution), speeding up bug resolution.",
  "tutorialContributeStep4Title": "Attachments and Links",
  "tutorialContributeStep4Message": "Add **supporting files** (audio, sheet music, or screenshots up to 32 MB) and YouTube or Google Drive **links**.",
  "tutorialContributeStep5Title": "Submit Contribution",
  "tutorialContributeStep5Message": "Tap **Submit** to send your report. If you are not signed in, sign in with your **Google account** to submit.",
  "tutorialContributeStep6Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialContributeStep6Message": "Tap this icon anytime to review this **step-by-step guide** for the suggestion submission screen.",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep1Title": "Submission Title and Status",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep1Message": "Track the **contribution title** and its current status (**Pending**, **Approved**, or **Rejected**).",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep2Title": "Contribution Type",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep2Message": "Indicates the category of collaboration sent, such as **Chords**, **Lyrics**, **Sheet Music**, or **Information Correction**.",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep3Title": "Description and Notes",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep3Message": "Here you can see the **descriptive text**, justifications, and external links added when the proposal was submitted.",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep4Title": "Changed Fields",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep4Message": "When the contribution proposes correcting data, see the direct comparison between the **current** and **proposed** value.",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep5Title": "Files and Antivirus Check",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep5Message": "View the list of **submitted attachments** and real-time security check status (**Clean**, **Scanning**, or **Blocked**).",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep6Title": "Moderation Feedback",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep6Message": "When the PLPCG team evaluates the submission, the **reviewers' feedback and justification** will appear in this area.",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep7Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialContributionDetailStep7Message": "Whenever you have questions about contribution details, tap this **(i) icon** to review this step-by-step tutorial!",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep1Title": "Toolbar & Shortcuts",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep1Message": "Use quick shortcuts to **add verses**, **remove lines**, **insert chords or annotations**, and restore original text.",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep2Title": "Editing Area",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep2Message": "Edit content directly. For chords, use the **[Chord]** syntax immediately before the syllable to sync placement with lyrics.",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep3Title": "Children's Gestures Selector",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep3Message": "Tap **Change Gesture** to open the official dictionary and link the movement to the corresponding trigger phrase.",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep4Title": "Live Preview",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep4Message": "Track changes **in real time** with rendering identical to what users will see in the praise reader.",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep5Title": "Proposal Submission",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep5Message": "Add notes if desired and tap **Submit** to make your suggestion available for community review.",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep6Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialExtractedMaterialEditorStep6Message": "Tap this icon anytime to review this **step-by-step guide** for the material editor.",
  "tutorialFavoriteMaterialKindsStep1Title": "Material Priority",
  "tutorialFavoriteMaterialKindsStep1Message": "Set up to **4 favorite materials** to prioritize your instruments and voices at the top of search results and in the reader.",
  "tutorialFavoriteMaterialKindsStep2Title": "Your Favorites and Order",
  "tutorialFavoriteMaterialKindsStep2Message": "Track your selected materials. Drag by the **side handle** to set priority, toggle **preferred format**, or tap **(X)** to remove.",
  "tutorialFavoriteMaterialKindsStep3Title": "Add New Materials",
  "tutorialFavoriteMaterialKindsStep3Message": "Search for instruments (e.g., **guitar**, **bass**, **organ**) or voices and tap the **(+)** icon to add them to your priority list.",
  "tutorialFavoriteMaterialKindsStep4Title": "Cloud Sync",
  "tutorialFavoriteMaterialKindsStep4Message": "Sign in with your **Google account** to save and synchronize your material preferences across any device.",
  "tutorialFavoriteMaterialKindsStep5Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialFavoriteMaterialKindsStep5Message": "Tap the **(i) icon** anytime to review this guide or learn more about application features!",
  "tutorialFiltersStep1Title": "Key Filter",
  "tutorialFiltersStep1Message": "Filter the catalog by **musical key** (C, D, E...) and accidentals to find praises in your team's exact key.",
  "tutorialFiltersStep2Title": "Rhythm Filter",
  "tutorialFiltersStep2Message": "Select specific time signatures and rhythms such as **Waltz**, **March**, **Basic**, or **Toada** to tailor setlists to the service.",
  "tutorialFiltersStep3Title": "Worship Categories and Tags",
  "tutorialFiltersStep3Message": "Refine hymns by **service occasion**, such as **Communion**, **Lord's Supper**, **Children**, or devotional moments.",
  "tutorialFiltersStep4Title": "Material Types",
  "tutorialFiltersStep4Message": "Restrict results to display only praises that have **Chords**, **Sheet Music**, **Children's Gestures**, or **Audio** available.",
  "tutorialFiltersStep5Title": "Clear Filters",
  "tutorialFiltersStep5Message": "Tap **Clear** to instantly reset all applied filters and view the full collection.",
  "tutorialFiltersStep6Title": "Filters Help",
  "tutorialFiltersStep6Message": "Tap this icon whenever you want to review guidelines on **combining advanced filters**.",
  "tutorialGestureFocusStep1Title": "Featured Gesture Card",
  "tutorialGestureFocusStep1Message": "View the gesture movement in an **enlarged size**, with animation or illustration for easy following by the conductor.",
  "tutorialGestureFocusStep2Title": "Trigger Phrase & Lyric",
  "tutorialGestureFocusStep2Message": "Follow the associated lyric, highlighted in **red on the trigger** where the gesture should be executed by the worship group.",
  "tutorialGestureFocusStep3Title": "Gesture Navigation",
  "tutorialGestureFocusStep3Message": "Tap the **sides of the screen**, **swipe horizontally**, or use the **keyboard arrows (← and →)** to step forward or backward.",
  "tutorialGestureFocusStep4Title": "Next Trigger",
  "tutorialGestureFocusStep4Message": "Check the footer for the **word or phrase of the next gesture**, preparing the transition before it happens.",
  "tutorialGestureFocusStep5Title": "Focus Mode Help",
  "tutorialGestureFocusStep5Message": "Tap this icon to review this **step-by-step guide** or press **Esc** to close and return to the reader at any time.",
  "tutorialGesturesStep1Title": "Lyrics Font Size",
  "tutorialGesturesStep1Message": "Increase or decrease the **text size** of praises for more comfortable reading during rehearsals or services.",
  "tutorialGesturesStep2Title": "Auto-Scroll",
  "tutorialGesturesStep2Message": "Enable **auto-scroll** (**S** key) to follow gestures without touching the screen. Adjust **speed** on the speedometer or with **[** and **]**.",
  "tutorialGesturesStep3Title": "Linear vs. Structured Mode",
  "tutorialGesturesStep3Message": "Switch between **structured** display (grouped by stanzas and choruses) and **linear** reading (continuous sequence with all full repeats).",
  "tutorialGesturesStep4Title": "Theme and Fullscreen",
  "tutorialGesturesStep4Message": "Switch between **light and dark mode** for better visibility, and use **fullscreen** mode (**F** key) to hide bars and focus on gestures.",
  "tutorialGesturesStep5Title": "Gesture Cards",
  "tutorialGesturesStep5Message": "Gestures appear synchronized with corresponding words. Tap any **gesture card** to open **focus view** with enlarged image and detailed description.",
  "tutorialGesturesStep6Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialGesturesStep6Message": "Whenever you have questions about using the gesture reader, tap this **(i) icon** to review this step-by-step tutorial!",
  "tutorialHomeStep1Title": "Smart Search",
  "tutorialHomeStep1Message": "Type the **number** of the praise, the **title**, or an **excerpt of the lyrics** to locate it instantly in the catalog.",
  "tutorialHomeStep2Title": "Active Filters",
  "tutorialHomeStep2Message": "When **active**, the selected filter button gets a **golden highlight**. The header displays the **active filters** count and you can tap **'Clear filters'** to reset.",
  "tutorialHomeStep3Title": "Inactive Filters",
  "tutorialHomeStep3Message": "With filters **inactive** (unselected), search covers **the entire catalog**. Tap any button to **activate it** or collapse the panel to save space.",
  "tutorialHomeStep4Title": "Main Navigation",
  "tutorialHomeStep4Message": "Easily switch between the Praise **Search**, your saved **Playlists**, and your user **Profile**.",
  "tutorialHomeStep5Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialHomeStep5Message": "Whenever you have questions about using any screen, tap this **(i) icon** to review step-by-step explanations!",
  "tutorialLibraryStep1Title": "Catalog Filters",
  "tutorialLibraryStep1Message": "Refine the full library by **musical key**, **rhythm**, **categories/tags**, or **material type** (sheet music, chords, audio). Tap the header to **expand or collapse** filters.",
  "tutorialLibraryStep2Title": "Catalog Sorting",
  "tutorialLibraryStep2Message": "Quickly switch the order of praises between **'By number'** (official hymnal number) or **'By name'** (alphabetical order of titles).",
  "tutorialLibraryStep3Title": "Pagination and Display",
  "tutorialLibraryStep3Message": "Check the **total praises** found, select the **items per page** (10, 20, 50...), and use the **navigation arrows** to browse the catalog.",
  "tutorialLibraryStep4Title": "Praise Cards",
  "tutorialLibraryStep4Message": "Each card shows the praise number, title, and details. Tap it to directly access its **sheet music**, **chords**, **audio**, and **full details**.",
  "tutorialLibraryStep5Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialLibraryStep5Message": "Whenever you have questions about navigating or using the Library, tap this **(i) icon** to review this step-by-step guide!",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep1Title": "Room Code and QR Code",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep1Message": "Participants can scan this **QR code** with their phone camera or use the **direct link** to follow the service.",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep2Title": "Share and Manage",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep2Message": "Copy or **share the link** to the broadcast with the group or tap **generate new link** if you need to reset access.",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep3Title": "Connected Participants",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep3Message": "Track in real time the **number of members** who are tuned in and following chords and lyrics in your room.",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep4Title": "End Broadcast",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep4Message": "Tap **End** to conclude the live session with participants and return to your playlists.",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep5Title": "Broadcast Status",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep5Message": "Track session progress: see if the leader is **live**, waiting for the service, or if the connection is **syncing**.",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep6Title": "Save Copy",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep6Message": "At the end of the service, tap **Save copy** to save the setlist directly to your personal playlists.",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep7Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialLiveRoomStep7Message": "Tap this icon anytime to review this **step-by-step guide** for the live room.",
  "tutorialLyricsStep1Title": "Lyrics Font Size",
  "tutorialLyricsStep1Message": "Increase or decrease the **font size** of lyrics for more comfortable reading during rehearsals or services. You can also use **Ctrl + ↑ / ↓** (or **Cmd + ↑ / ↓**).",
  "tutorialLyricsStep2Title": "Auto-Scroll",
  "tutorialLyricsStep2Message": "Enable **auto-scroll** (**S** key) to read lyrics hands-free. Tap the **speedometer** to adjust speed (or use the **[** and **]** keys).",
  "tutorialLyricsStep3Title": "Fullscreen Mode",
  "tutorialLyricsStep3Message": "Tap the **fullscreen** button (or **F** key) to hide all bars and focus entirely on reading lyrics.",
  "tutorialLyricsStep4Title": "Text Reading and Selection",
  "tutorialLyricsStep4Message": "Lyrics are available **completely offline**. Text is selectable for copying excerpts, and scrolling smoothly pauses when you touch the screen.",
  "tutorialLyricsStep5Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialLyricsStep5Message": "Whenever you have questions about using the lyrics reader, tap this **(i) icon** to review this step-by-step tutorial!",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep1Title": "Available Formats",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep1Message": "Switch between **Sheet Music**, **Chords**, **Children's Gestures**, **Audio**, and **YouTube** videos to choose the ideal format for service or rehearsal.",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep2Title": "Add to Setlist",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep2Message": "Tap the **+** button to include this arrangement directly in your active **Service Carousel** list or one of your **Playlists**.",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep3Title": "Metadata and Lyrics",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep3Message": "Check the **original key**, **rhythm**, **worship categories**, and preview the praise lyrics.",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep4Title": "Related Versions",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep4Message": "Quickly select **alternative arrangements**, versions in other keys, or hymns related to the selected praise.",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep5Title": "Suggest Improvement",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep5Message": "Found any discrepancy in chords, lyrics, or sheet music? Tap here to send a **correction suggestion** to curators.",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep6Title": "Selector Help",
  "tutorialMaterialSheetStep6Message": "Tap this icon whenever you need guidance on how to **choose materials** and **organize your setlist**.",
  "tutorialMyContributionsStep1Title": "Sign-In Required",
  "tutorialMyContributionsStep1Message": "Sign in with your **Google account** to access the history of suggestions, corrections, and materials you submitted.",
  "tutorialMyContributionsStep2Title": "No Submissions Yet",
  "tutorialMyContributionsStep2Message": "All **lyric, sheet music, or correction suggestions** submitted by you via the **Contribute** button will be listed on this screen.",
  "tutorialMyContributionsStep3Title": "Submission History",
  "tutorialMyContributionsStep3Message": "View the title, material type, and date of your collaboration. Tap any row to open the **details screen** and view team notes.",
  "tutorialMyContributionsStep4Title": "Review Status",
  "tutorialMyContributionsStep4Message": "Track the progress of your request: **pending**, **under review**, **approved**, or **rejected**.",
  "tutorialMyContributionsStep5Title": "Help & Tutorials",
  "tutorialMyContributionsStep5Message": "Tap the **(i) icon** anytime to review this guide or learn more about application screens!",
  "tutorialOfflineStep1Title": "Status and Disk Usage",
  "tutorialOfflineStep1Message": "Track total praises in the **local catalog**, the **last sync** date, and the **used and free space** on the device. Tap **Refresh** to recalculate data.",
  "tutorialOfflineStep2Title": "Material Search",
  "tutorialOfflineStep2Message": "Use the search field to quickly find specific types of sheet music or chords (e.g., **guitar**, **collection**, **choir**) and enable **Filter** to display only matching results.",
  "tutorialOfflineStep3Title": "Format Selection",
  "tutorialOfflineStep3Message": "Select the **material types** you want to keep available offline. On each item you can individually toggle between **sheet music (PDF)**, **chords**, and **audio**.",
  "tutorialOfflineStep4Title": "Download and Manage Storage",
